      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而下一场比赛是“朝日杯未来锦标”，\n那是距离只有1600米的英里赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66e04c9997706935d0bc5201b7d2fa654fb6ffedb3b1f0657bb315a24fa6a669",
